.PP
The colored theme.
.RE
.TP 4
\fBKEYS = Role.values.to_h do |role| {Theme.key(role), role} end\fR
Config keys of the roles: \fB\%heading1\fR, \fB\%bold\-italic\fR, \fB\%code\-block\fR...
.TP 4
\fBMONOCHROME\fR
