.TP 4
\fBPAINT = /\eA([a\-z0\-9#]+(?:\-[a\-z]+)?)(?:([+\-])(\ed{1,3}))?\ez/\fR
A color word with an optional ramp.
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.new(overrides : Hash(Role, Spec) = {} of Role => Spec)\fR
The default theme with \fIoverrides\fR (from \fB\%[colors]\fR in config.ini).
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.default_specs : Hash(Role, Spec)\fR
\fB\%DEFAULT\fR parsed.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.key(role : Role) : String\fR
The config key of \fIrole\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.monochrome_specs : Hash(Role, Spec)\fR
\fB\%MONOCHROME\fR parsed.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.parse(text : String) : Spec\fR
Parses a spec; raises \fB\%Error\fR on unknown words.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.PP
\fBdef specs : Hash(Role, Spec)\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef styles(palette : Palette, depth : ColorDepth) : Array(UInt16)\fR
The style id of every role for \fIpalette\fR at \fIdepth\fR, indexed by
\fB\%Role#value\fR. At \fB\%ColorDepth::None\fR the roles take \fB\%MONOCHROME\fR.
